---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<aside
	class="mb-4 flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-(--radius-large) border border-(--line-divider) bg-(--card-bg) px-5 py-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center"
	aria-labelledby="maintenance-notice-title"
>
	<div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-(--primary)/15 text-(--primary)">
		<Icon is:inline name="material-symbols:construction-rounded" class="text-2xl" />
	</div>
	<div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
		<h2 id="maintenance-notice-title" class="font-bold text-(--primary)">网站正在重构</h2>
		<p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-(--text-muted)">目前评论功能暂时无法使用</p>
		<p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-(--text-muted)">
			如有任何疑问，请联系站长或加入 QQ 群交流。
		</p>
	</div>
	<div class="flex shrink-0 gap-2">
		<a href="mailto:olinl@foxmail.com" class="btn-regular rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm">
			联系站长
		</a>
		<a
			href="https://qm.qq.com/q/fFoJQDz5rG"
			target="_blank"
			rel="noopener noreferrer"
			class="btn-regular rounded-lg bg-(--primary) px-3 py-2 text-sm text-white hover:bg-(--primary)"
		>
			加入 QQ 群
		</a>
	</div>
</aside>
